[2026-03-14T21:21:08.977Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CPKx4GoBkm7qdJgHMX2zeZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1310-\n1311-### Component: ReviewForm\n1312-\n1313:#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n1314-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n1315-- **Expected:** A text area is visible with a placeholder such as \"Write your review...\" or \"Tell others about your experience\" for entering the review comment.\n1316-\n1317:#### Test: Submit button is visible\n1318-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n1319-- **Expected:** A \"Submit Review\" button is visible at the bottom of the form.\n1320-\n1321:#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n1322-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with an empty comment text area.\n1323-- **Action:** User types \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\" in the comment text area.\n1324-- **Expected:** The text area displays the typed text \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\"\n1325-\n1326:#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n1327-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set Overall to 5, Cleanliness to 5, Accuracy to 4, Communication to 5, Location to 4, Value to 4, and typed \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\" in the comment area.\n1328-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n1329-- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully via `POST /api/reviews`. The app navigates back to `/trips` (My Trips page). A success notification or message such as \"Review submitted successfully\" appears.\n1330-\n1331:#### Test: Submitted review appears on property detail page\n1332-- **Initial state:** User just submitted a review for booking-789 (property \"Oceanfront Villa\") with Overall rating 5 and comment \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\".\n1333-- **Action:** User navigates to the property detail page for \"Oceanfront Villa\" (`/properties/:id`).\n1334-- **Expected:** The reviews section shows the newly submitted review with the guest's name, the rating of 5, and the comment \"Wonderful experience, would definitely come back!\". The property's average rating and review count are updated.\n1335-\n1336:#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n1337-- **Initial state:** User just submitted a review for \"Oceanfront Villa\".\n1338-- **Action:** User navigates to `/profile`.\n1339-- **Expected:** The user's reviews list includes the newly submitted review for \"Oceanfront Villa\" with the correct rating and comment.\n1340-\n1341:#### Test: Submit review with ratings but no comment\n1342-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set all six rating sliders (Overall: 3, Cleanliness: 3, Accuracy: 3, Communication: 3, Location: 3, Value: 3) but left the comment text area empty.\n1343-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n1344-- **Expected:** The review is submitted successfully (comment is optional per the data model). The app navigates back to `/trips`.\n1345-\n1346:#### Test: Submit button is disabled when ratings are not set\n1347-- **Initial state:** User navigates to the Write Review page. No rating sliders have been adjusted from their unset/default state.\n1348-- **Expected:** The \"Submit Review\" button is disabled or grayed out, preventing submission without ratings.\n1349-\n1350:#### Test: Form validation prevents submission without all ratings\n1351-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set Overall to 5 but left other rating sliders unset.\n1352-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Submit Review\" button.\n1353-- **Expected:** The form shows a validation error indicating all ratings are required (e.g., \"Please rate all categories\"). The review is not submitted.\n1354-\n1355:#### Test: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n1356-- **Initial state:** User has a completed booking for \"Oceanfront Villa\" showing a \"Write Review\" button on the My Trips page.\n1357-- **Action:** User clicks \"Write Review\", fills out all ratings (all set to 4) and a comment \"Great stay!\", and clicks \"Submit Review\". User is redirected to `/trips`.\n1358-- **Expected:** The trip card for \"Oceanfront Villa\" no longer shows the \"Write Review\" button. It may show \"Reviewed\" text or a checkmark instead.\n1359-\n1360:#### Test: Navigate back from review page without submitting\n1361-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page and has set some ratings and typed partial comment text.\n1362-- **Action:** User clicks the browser back button or a \"Cancel\" / back navigation link on the page.\n1363-- **Expected:** The user is taken back to `/trips`. No review is submitted. The \"Write Review\" button still appears on the trip card.\n1364-\n1365:#### Test: Comment text area allows multi-line input\n1366-- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n1367-- **Action:** User types a multi-line comment: \"First line.\\nSecond line.\\nThird line.\" using Enter/Return key to create line breaks.\n1368-- **Expected:** The text area displays the comment with line breaks preserved across all three lines.\n1369-\n1370:#### Test: Re-visiting review page after submission shows already-reviewed state\n1371-- **Initial state:** User \"guest@example.com\" has already submitted a review for booking-789.\n1372-- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` directly via URL.\n1373-- **Expected:** The page displays a message such as \"You have already reviewed this booking\" instead of the review form. A link to return to My Trips is available."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014kKtgwxud1bCMasj5sEnQZ","session_id":"f9a10ac0-bbdf-4066-b957-0d7c86e1c5c4","uuid":"47f331df-89d0-4768-bb1f-d25346560ff4"}
