ple.com\".\n  1247→- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review`.\n  1248→- **Expected:** The page displays an error message such as \"You cannot review this booking\" and does not show the review form.\n  1249→\n  1250→#### Test: Error state when booking is not completed\n  1251→- **Initial state:** User \"guest@example.com\" is logged in with a booking (booking-pending) that has status \"pending\".\n  1252→- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips/booking-pending/review`.\n  1253→- **Expected:** The page displays an error message such as \"You can only review completed bookings\" and does not show the review form.\n  1254→\n  1255→#### Test: Error state when review already exists for booking\n  1256→- **Initial state:** User \"guest@example.com\" is logged in with a completed booking (booking-reviewed) that already has a review submitted.\n  1257→- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips/booking-reviewed/review`.\n  1258→- **Expected:** The page displays a message such as \"You have already reviewed this booking\" and does not show the review form. Optionally shows a link back to My Trips.\n  1259→\n  1260→### Component: RatingSliders\n  1261→\n  1262→#### Test: All six rating sliders display with default values\n  1263→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n  1264→- **Expected:** Six rating sliders are visible with labels: \"Overall\", \"Cleanliness\", \"Accuracy\", \"Communication\", \"Location\", and \"Value\". Each slider defaults to a mid-range value (e.g., 3 out of 5) or is unset, and shows the current numeric value.\n  1265→\n  1266→#### Test: Adjust overall rating slider\n  1267→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1268→- **Action:** User drags the \"Overall\" slider to 5.\n  1269→- **Expected:** The \"Overall\" slider displays value 5. The numeric display next to the slider updates to \"5\". Other sliders remain at their previous values.\n  1270→\n  1271→#### Test: Adjust cleanliness rating slider\n  1272→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1273→- **Action:** User drags the \"Cleanliness\" slider to 4.\n  1274→- **Expected:** The \"Cleanliness\" slider displays value 4. The numeric display updates to \"4\".\n  1275→\n  1276→#### Test: Adjust accuracy rating slider\n  1277→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1278→- **Action:** User drags the \"Accuracy\" slider to 2.\n  1279→- **Expected:** The \"Accuracy\" slider displays value 2. The numeric display updates to \"2\".\n  1280→\n  1281→#### Test: Adjust communication rating slider\n  1282→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1283→- **Action:** User drags the \"Communication\" slider to 5.\n  1284→- **Expected:** The \"Communication\" slider displays value 5. The numeric display updates to \"5\".\n  1285→\n  1286→#### Test: Adjust location rating slider\n  1287→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1288→- **Action:** User drags the \"Location\" slider to 3.\n  1289→- **Expected:** The \"Location\" slider displays value 3. The numeric display updates to \"3\".\n  1290→\n  1291→#### Test: Adjust value rating slider\n  1292→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1293→- **Action:** User drags the \"Value\" slider to 1.\n  1294→- **Expected:** The \"Value\" slider displays value 1. The numeric display updates to \"1\".\n  1295→\n  1296→#### Test: Rating sliders enforce 1-5 range\n  1297→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1298→- **Action:** User interacts with any rating slider.\n  1299→- **Expected:** The slider only allows integer values from 1 to 5 inclusive. The slider cannot go below 1 or above 5.\n  1300→\n  1301→#### Test: Multiple sliders can be set independently\n  1302→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with all sliders at default.\n  1303→- **Action:** User sets \"Overall\" to 5, \"Cleanliness\" to 4, \"Accuracy\" to 3, \"Communication\" to 5, \"Location\" to 4, \"Value\" to 2.\n  1304→- **Expected:** Each slider displays its independently set value. No slider affects another slider's value.\n  1305→\n  1306→#### Test: Rating slider visual feedback shows filled stars or highlighted segments\n  1307→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1308→- **Action:** User sets the \"Overall\" slider to 4.\n  1309→- **Expected:** The slider visually indicates the selected rating (e.g., filled stars up to 4 out of 5, or a highlighted slider track up to the 4 position). The visual feedback clearly distinguishes selected vs unselected portions.\n  1310→\n  1311→### Component: ReviewForm\n  1312→\n  1313→#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n  1314→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips/booking-789/review` for a completed booking.\n  1315→- **Expected:** A text area is visible with a placeholder such as \"Write your review...\" or \"Tell others about your experience\" for entering the review comment.\n  1316→\n  1317→#### Test: Submit button is visible\n  1318→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page.\n  1319→- **Expected:** A \"Submit Review\" button is visible at the bottom of the form.\n  1320→\n  1321→#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n  1322→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page with an empty comment text area.\n  1323→- **Action:** User types \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\" in the comment text area.\n  1324→- **Expected:** The text area displays the typed text \"Amazing stay! The villa was beautiful and the host was very responsive.\"\n  1325→\n  1326→#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n  1327→- **Initial state:** User is on the Write Review page. User has set Overall to 