[2026-03-14T21:22:24.173Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011SVqbtmZjNurFdjAqe1G7E","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have successfully retrieved all the requested files. Here's a complete summary of the full file contents:\n\n## File 1: TripsTabs.tsx\nComplete file showing a tabbed interface for filtering bookings (upcoming, past, cancelled) with a TripCard component for each booking.\n\n**Key features:**\n- Filters bookings by status and date\n- Three tabs: Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n- Renders TripCard component for each filtered booking\n- Empty state handling per tab\n\n## File 2: TripCard.tsx\nIndividual trip/booking card component displaying property details and booking information.\n\n**Key features:**\n- Shows property image, title, location, and dates\n- Status badge display\n- Conditional buttons:\n  - Cancel button (for pending/confirmed bookings)\n  - \"Write Review\" button (for completed bookings without review)\n  - \"Reviewed ✓\" badge (for completed bookings with review)\n- Uses `has_review` property from Booking type to determine review status\n- Navigation to review form: `/trips/${booking.id}/review`\n\n## File 3: ReviewsSection.tsx\nComponent for displaying reviews on a property detail page.\n\n**Key features:**\n- Shows average rating and review count\n- Displays rating categories (cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value) with progress bars\n- Shows individual review cards with guest info, date, rating, and comment\n- Initially shows 6 reviews with \"Show all\" toggle\n- Empty state handling\n\n## File 4: reviewFormSlice.ts\nRedux slice for managing review form state and submission.\n\n**Key types:**\n- `BookingDetail`: Contains booking info needed for review (includes `has_review: boolean`)\n- Thunks: `fetchBookingForReview`, `submitReview`\n- Validation checks on fetch: status === 'completed', has_review === false\n\n## File 5: bookingsSlice.ts\nRedux slice for managing user bookings.\n\n**Key type:**\n- `Booking`: Includes `has_review?: boolean` property\n- Thunks: `createBooking`, `fetchUserBookings`, `cancelBooking`\n- Booking statuses: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n\n## File 6: reviews.ts (Netlify Function)\nAPI handler for GET/POST/DELETE operations on reviews.\n\n**Functionality:**\n- GET: Fetch reviews by guest_id or property_id\n- POST: Create new review with validation (checks for existing review by booking_id)\n- DELETE: Remove review by ID\n- Returns review data with calculated fields (guest_name, guest_avatar, property_title)\n\nAll files are located in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: afe002407699d5b76 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 27657\ntool_uses: 6\nduration_ms: 9155</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9a10ac0-bbdf-4066-b957-0d7c86e1c5c4","uuid":"327d89c4-0b69-4f72-b54d-a16699453209","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read and return the FULL contents of these files in /repo/apps/AirbnbClone:\n1. src/components/TripsTabs.tsx\n2. src/components/TripCard.tsx (or whatever the trip card component is called)\n3. src/components/ReviewsSection.tsx\n4. src/slices/reviewFormSlice.ts\n5. src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts (just the types and thunks related to bookings - specifically how booking has review info)\n6. netlify/functions/reviews.ts\n\nReturn FULL file contents for all files.","agentId":"afe002407699d5b76","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have successfully retrieved all the requested files. Here's a complete summary of the full file contents:\n\n## File 1: TripsTabs.tsx\nComplete file showing a tabbed interface for filtering bookings (upcoming, past, cancelled) with a TripCard component for each booking.\n\n**Key features:**\n- Filters bookings by status and date\n- Three tabs: Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n- Renders TripCard component for each filtered booking\n- Empty state handling per tab\n\n## File 2: TripCard.tsx\nIndividual trip/booking card component displaying property details and booking information.\n\n**Key features:**\n- Shows property image, title, location, and dates\n- Status badge display\n- Conditional buttons:\n  - Cancel button (for pending/confirmed bookings)\n  - \"Write Review\" button (for completed bookings without review)\n  - \"Reviewed ✓\" badge (for completed bookings with review)\n- Uses `has_review` property from Booking type to determine review status\n- Navigation to review form: `/trips/${booking.id}/review`\n\n## File 3: ReviewsSection.tsx\nComponent for displaying reviews on a property detail page.\n\n**Key features:**\n- Shows average rating and review count\n- Displays rating categories (cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value) with progress bars\n- Shows individual review cards with guest info, date, rating, and comment\n- Initially shows 6 reviews with \"Show all\" toggle\n- Empty state handling\n\n## File 4: reviewFormSlice.ts\nRedux slice for managing review form state and submission.\n\n**Key types:**\n- `BookingDetail`: Contains booking info needed for review (includes `has_review: boolean`)\n- Thunks: `fetchBookingForReview`, `submitReview`\n- Validation checks on fetch: status === 'completed', has_review === false\n\n## File 5: bookingsSlice.ts\nRedux slice for managing user bookings.\n\n**Key type:**\n- `Booking`: Includes `has_review?: boolean` property\n- Thunks: `createBooking`, `fetchUserBookings`, `cancelBooking`\n- Booking statuses: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n\n## File 6: reviews.ts (Netlify Function)\nAPI handler for GET/POST/DELETE operations on reviews.\n\n**Functionality:**\n- GET: Fetch reviews by guest_id or property_id\n- POST: Create new review with validation (checks for existing review by booking_id)\n- DELETE: Remove review by ID\n- Returns review data with calculated fields (guest_name, guest_avatar, property_title)\n\nAll files are located in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`"}],"totalDurationMs":9155,"totalTokens":27657,"totalToolUseCount":6,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9811,"cache_read_input_tokens":17206,"output_tokens":633,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9811},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
